# Crawler output. data/crawl/verification.json is registry EVIDENCE and stays
# tracked; everything below is run state that a fresh crawl reproduces.
#
# data/crawl/raw/ is the FR-54 retention store — the raw bytes of every page
# fetched from every ministry, growing by thousands of files per weekly run.
# It belongs in the same domestic managed storage as the audit log under the
# NFR-11 residency policy, not in the git history of a public repository.
